n. Wanna decorate a house you made on a mountain by a lake? You can. Wanna do crime? You absolutely can lol\n\nCons:\n-500+ hours in and I have no idea what the plot is\n-Having multiple pals working in the same location causes the SteamDeck to drop frames\n-There are spots on the map where you can glitch into the ground and get stuck. I don’t recommend playing on higher levels because of this and the death penalty\n-Currently the end game (in early access) is unbalanced for a solo player. I have no one playing this with me and it’s a hell of a grind to get enough to do the final bits\n-Are we gonna talk about catching humans in the spheres or……….?\n\n\nIn Summary:\nEvery dollar you spend on a game should be at least 1 hour of entertainment. This game is an absolute steal for the price and I would recommend it to anyone who wants a fun time running around catching Pals and daydreaming.", "timestamp_created": 1780871116, "timestamp_updated": 1780871116, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 156, "votes_funny": 6, "weighted_vote_score": "0.862906932830810547", "comment_count": 7, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": true, "app_release_date": "1705651175", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 26, "count": 4}, {"reaction_type": 27, "count": 4}]}, {"recommendationid": "227446446", "author": {"steamid": "76561198057121523", "personaname": "Tauph85", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/tauph85/", "num_games_owned": 258, "num_reviews": 23, "playtime_forever": 1420, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 944, "last_played": 1785546440, "avatar": "53c5047805cd7299a6306372f742261612b34fa4"}, "language": "english", "review": "shis dope", "timestamp_created": 1780870868, "timestamp_updated": 1780870868, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": fal